\section{Not tax advice}{

The tables report published rates and thresholds. The band helpers apply a
schedule and nothing else: allowances, credits, tapers, surcharges and the
authorities' rounding rules are not applied.
}

\section{Options}{

\itemize{
\item \code{calcbloc.base_url}: API base URL (default \code{"https://calcbloc.com/api/v1"}).
\item \code{calcbloc.timeout}: request timeout in seconds (default 30).
\item \code{calcbloc.min_interval}: minimum seconds between API requests (default 1).
\item \code{calcbloc.max_wait}: longest \code{Retry-After} wait, in seconds, the client
accepts before giving up on a rate-limited request (default 60).
\item \code{calcbloc.max_retries}: retries after HTTP 429 or 503 (default 2).
}
